          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On March 31, 2008, between 10:20 and 10:30, a group of people at an airport observed a puzzling light phenomenon: successive white glowing rings moved across the sky. No sound was heard during the observation. A local witness claims that advertising laser light shows are frequently used in this area by restaurants or nightclubs. Therefore, the GEIPAN classifies this case as \"B\": probable light show.",
